IqOpfMHbVJbgU0Ci2td9_8LyPCnC-58tXW3xxva5cCux59m2SzBEQHOQrXDmFE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI3vqWW46P7KX9m5_AWX09n6At1WcCq6-OFoJfmOpWPjw&oe=6A986397"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pTXfsBY9L00Q7kNvwGuqf-8&_nc_oc=AdoRm1qmbvs6xqv9inPR9X4Ln1ekjYxXB7ODipAI5DFllgXYOxaGOx-8pfm2rgg4AxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQItODZ9MUEAZJ4MZuLfOpIuEfPALRvDjItHUn8YT-vy0A&oe=6A9861A1"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7ChIgdcDTIYQ7kNvwEr6696&_nc_oc=AdqJ5Vl4j3sYUsqVd9VcYaa5QLyUogfiqKCTC7RnLY_KhIjkFSOzN37AHXYagfuSeqs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIa3SLY84VPyWW6KlFJwHXaiaARcWwDGUdRo_JfTpiv-Q&oe=6A984FD7"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aekcDTsa3gcQ7kNvwE3mYD_&_nc_oc=Adr5mhK1U9lg5O7H2V3ndg7p1naoKp3nA_VAaoaaXyGG-movVtQkitITjBOezyFIXP0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJLthR7vALH8Y_U8XUockoJcacxKO9xpzALqJvfpWIyMA&oe=6A985662"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lLGYh2CKzR0Q7kNvwEjh-LN&_nc_oc=AdptwRwlymLK7QZVtY9D0qjoNPmO0135dRmM7-73c8We9ZE56RaQ2sSa9iqsVqOvoSU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI__ihDjozBK1qJVFzQltn_N4uYC4MvjKcuMEeyU0ZrUw&oe=6A9842AE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null